confirmed.cause:
CategoriesExplorer.tsx:73-90 starts four reads after the chunk mounts:
- loadPhotoPool() = /api/products?sort=available&limit=50 (src/lib/catalog/data.ts:57-63), 50 full product cards, used only to borrow one photo per banner row;
- fetchGradedStock() = the whole /api/home (src/lib/api.ts:1958-1962), used only to read open_box;
- /api/bundles?limit=4;
- /api/catalog/tree.
None of the six root categories has an authored picture (every image_url and hero_* field in the live tree is empty). So bannerRows (explorerModel.ts:162-179) can only place the LCP banner photo once the 160 KB JSON pool has arrived.

confirmed.fix:
Add /categories, /categories/*, /community and /community/* (ideally every main-host SPA path) to run_worker_first in all three environments. Widen the mainOpening branch in assetWithPreview to:
- write the main-host resolve block (no DB read, as it already does for '/');
- modulepreload chunkPreloads(manifest, routeModuleFor(path)), with routeModuleFor taught src/pages/CategoriesExplorer.tsx, CategoryPage.tsx and CategoryListing.tsx;
- add <link rel=preload as=fetch> for /api/catalog/tree or /api/catalog/<slug>, and /api/community/access on community paths.

Measured gain: −1.4 to −1.8 s LCP on phone category pages, about −0.3 s on /community.
